Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：奉奶奶之命
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们来到远离城市的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.33,0:00:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}地方跑腿＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.19,0:00:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（3人）决斗庵！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜　可那里竟是决斗的修行场{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装傻的爷爷正在等着我们！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后　我和　爷爷{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.14,0:00:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用传说中的怪兽们进行木像决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.01,0:00:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是　不知为何我自己竟然变成了怪兽！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.28,0:00:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜我好像明白了什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在此时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟要和爷爷过去的弟子决斗！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.85,0:00:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）游马…　我也要战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜　侮辱爷爷的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.02,0:00:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身为弟子的我绝不原谅！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.91,0:00:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧　我！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.25,0:01:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（暗川）我盖两张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.29,0:01:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！我让怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.81,0:01:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，和同伴一起绝对要赢你！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.35,0:01:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵……一丝阴云都没有的如光一般的少年。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.23,0:01:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此，是师父喜欢的类型啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.06,0:01:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就让我来告诉你！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.94,0:01:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光无法撕裂黑暗是黑暗吞噬光芒！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）加油，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.34,0:01:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）可是这场决斗，总觉得好可怕。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.55,0:01:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（六十郎）那家伙的黑暗比以前更加深沉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.10,0:01:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.47,0:01:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我通过将攻击力降低500点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤这只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！怒怒怒战士！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.55,0:01:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（怒怒怒战士）怒怒怒～！怒～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:01:59.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵 急着填满场地吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是把我我我魔术师解放
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.75,0:02:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来召唤怒怒怒战士的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.03,0:02:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力本该超过刀锋之心才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.73,0:02:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么游马
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.76,0:02:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要降低怒怒怒战士的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.77,0:02:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来召唤我我我魔术师…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马一定是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.30,0:02:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你到头来是打算死守怪兽吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.17,0:02:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意见吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.46,0:02:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.22,0:02:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动魔法卡 浑身一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.27,0:02:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我场上的怪兽战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.81,0:02:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方都不会受到伤害直接破坏对方怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用怒怒怒战士
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击机甲忍者 刃心！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！怒怒怒斧头！！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.10,0:02:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 打开！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机甲忍法 冻结封锁！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.49,0:02:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上有忍者的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.08,0:02:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让对手怪兽的攻击结束{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后只要这张永续陷阱还在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的怪兽就不能改变表示形式。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.94,0:03:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.59,0:03:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来这招啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.14,0:03:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！我 这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.97,0:03:10.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不能输啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖放1张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.51,0:04:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动 间谍攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.03,0:04:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将手牌1只怪兽送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.76,0:04:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将你场上盖放的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.77,0:05:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以确认。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.14,0:05:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机甲忍者 水蓝！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以那条命为代价潜入敌阵{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.85,0:05:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}揭穿那家伙的盖牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.74,0:05:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪怕牺牲怪兽也要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是一味地追求胜利。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.45,0:05:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是他的决斗吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.19,0:05:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（春）吼哦 游马那小子居然打这种决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}六先生 这是你教的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小春啊 哦哦 好久不见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.91,0:05:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）姐姐也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）果然 已经在打决斗了！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧 姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.71,0:05:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你这家伙 又……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.66,0:05:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了 等一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 那孩子正拼命想要超越。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超越至今为止的自己。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.29,0:05:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信他吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是 你的职责。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.21,0:05:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.43,0:06:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}集中精神 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.61,0:06:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是来给你的死送行的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.45,0:06:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就 让我来为你送终吧送你这最后一程！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.15,0:06:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刃心 攻击我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}电磁拔刀 霞斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下第二刀吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再一次攻击对方怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.64,0:06:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用刀锋之心攻击怒怒怒战士！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.56,0:06:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的盖牌是 我我我回归。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以支付600点生命值为代价
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有让怪兽复活的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵 说到底你是想保护怪兽吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每只居然要600！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做到这种地步 让怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活到底有什么意义啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让那复活变得更加愚蠢吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:06:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 打开！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.57,0:06:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机甲忍法 最终迷雾！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当有忍者存在时 对方场上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.93,0:07:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.03,0:07:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 试着救你的同伴啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.11,0:07:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更会让你处于不利在这种状况下。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.47,0:07:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，别犹豫。贯彻你自己的想法。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.86,0:07:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用你的信念去战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老师的教导乍看之下并不合理{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但总觉得 在那前方能感受到通往胜利的秘策。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想看到那个。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.91,0:07:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.65,0:07:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动速攻魔法 我我我回归！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在我我我魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.77,0:07:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因战斗被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.23,0:07:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与被战斗破坏的同伴怪兽一起复活！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 每复活1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就要受到600点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.69,0:07:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:07:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.53,0:08:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值只剩300……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.15,0:08:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上永续陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.75,0:08:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机甲忍法 最终迷雾的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.86,0:08:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到对方场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.85,0:08:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.23,0:08:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，我就这样回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.38,0:08:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么你要为了怪兽做到这种地步……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力被削减你的生命值已是风中残烛。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.37,0:08:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵……你是打算和怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一起殉情吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.58,0:08:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我相信我的同伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.94,0:08:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天我的心意也会传达给怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它们一定会来救我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.67,0:08:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么能相通？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.15,0:08:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽会救你？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽才不是什么伙伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是不会说话的 决斗者的仆从！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.77,0:08:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 对这里像垃圾一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那套说教我实在忍不了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:08:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗是用黑暗与恐惧来支配的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对！ 那才不是决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.73,0:09:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 就算你说得再冠冕堂皇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.30,0:09:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的生命值 还剩３００。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在生命值 变成零之前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你所谓的那些伙伴要是救不了你的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.33,0:09:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是你输了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.92,0:09:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 我 相信怪兽…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 我相信伙伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.47,0:09:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！ 来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.49,0:09:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 我我我闪电！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.69,0:09:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我场上有名字带有「我我我」的怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方场上的1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我破坏机甲忍者 刃心！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（刃心）咕… 咕哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.45,0:09:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我用我我我魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.12,0:09:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜 呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 用怒怒怒战士 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.78,0:10:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.47,0:10:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想得美！我发动墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.19,0:10:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机甲忍者 水蓝的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡除外 无效1只怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.62,0:10:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.91,0:10:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回应我吧 伙伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.11,0:10:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怒怒怒战士攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方的魔法 陷阱 怪兽效果
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.53,0:10:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.17,0:10:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 拉斯特米斯特和艾克的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.14,0:10:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果就消失了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.71,0:10:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以直接攻击了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 怒怒怒战士！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.93,0:10:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怒怒怒战斧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗷～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.81,0:10:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？ 哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！ 哈 哈 哈…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.38,0:10:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了！ 我盖放一张卡回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到了吗！ 我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.99,0:10:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的心意传达给伙伴们了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:10:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行这场决斗的可不只有我们！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伙伴们也回应了这份心意！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.75,0:11:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是师父的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.40,0:11:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}六十郎爷爷的教诲！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了……什么爷爷的教诲。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.83,0:11:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我早已把那教诲……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.03,0:11:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超越了师父！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.87,0:11:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没有同伴不相信任何人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.57,0:11:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}靠自己战斗，靠自己获胜！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.11,0:11:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.50,0:11:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机甲忍法 黄金转换！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.69,0:11:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将场上的冠以忍法之名的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.87,0:11:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己破坏自己的陷阱卡吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后从卡组抽2张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.15,0:11:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底想干什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅当对方场上存在怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤 机甲忍者 地！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.73,0:11:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（地）地～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.78,0:11:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.47,0:11:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}情况有点不对劲。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动魔法卡 机甲忍法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.75,0:12:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不死回归！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.88,0:12:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将我墓地里的 1只忍者怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.30,0:12:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧！机甲忍者 火焰！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.53,0:12:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（火焰）火炎！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.12,0:12:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}火焰召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.47,0:12:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级提升1级。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.83,0:12:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵…哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.36,0:12:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙居然是 No.怪兽吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.73,0:12:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把你吞掉 小鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.93,0:12:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连你那一缕光芒也一并吞掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.80,0:12:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级5的机甲忍者 大地与
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.34,0:12:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机甲忍者 火焰 进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）大地 大地 火焰～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.70,0:12:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽 构建叠放网络
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建。 超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！ No.12！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.52,0:12:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机甲忍者 绯红影！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,————CM—————
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.24,0:13:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽才是我真正的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.44,0:13:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗中之暗！ 绯红影
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那些家伙包裹在黑暗中！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}编 No.！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都到这一步了居然还会出现 No.……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.40,0:13:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！ 居然连 No.都有！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽会将暗川拖入更深的黑暗……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.48,0:13:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强忍者的攻击你就好好尝尝吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.72,0:13:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用绯红影 攻击我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟 糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.59,0:13:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 是陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.11,0:13:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对 对了！ 陷阱卡 打开！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.57,0:13:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毅力卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.83,0:13:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将成为攻击对象的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.53,0:13:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与自身场上的其他怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行变更。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将攻击对象
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.41,0:13:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从嘎嘎嘎魔术师变更为多多多战士！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.62,0:14:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，成为攻击对象的怪兽不会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.03,0:14:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃！呜呜！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.22,0:14:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，垂死挣扎。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.04,0:14:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔，得救了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.97,0:14:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，下次攻击来的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.51,0:14:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}振作点，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.53,0:14:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种时候要是有决斗饭就好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.82,0:14:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.23,0:14:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人是铁饭是钢嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:35.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.81,0:14:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了小子？已经结束了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的还有那所谓相信同伴的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.05,0:14:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，想起来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.93,0:14:47.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想起与怪兽心意相通的那一刻。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.26,0:14:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想起老师的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.82,0:14:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手。住手啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.54,0:15:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（六十郎）去了解怪兽的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.31,0:15:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并试图回应它。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.41,0:15:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这份心意才能真正打动怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.29,0:15:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的心意。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.40,0:15:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕嗷…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.49,0:15:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那是。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是怪兽的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.72,0:15:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。管你是 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.53,0:15:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是什么，都无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要和同伴一起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跨越这场危机给你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.83,0:15:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.02,0:15:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.82,0:15:48.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗饭哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.21,0:15:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.75,0:15:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢啦 小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.11,0:15:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔～！　一飞冲天吧 我。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.15,0:16:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.18,0:16:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动速攻魔法 减量。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让场上存在的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.11,0:16:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的等级下降２级。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.63,0:16:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 怒怒怒战士的等级从６变成４。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级４的我我我魔术师和
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怒怒怒战士进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.45,0:16:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 No.３９ 希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（霍普）霍～普。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.41,0:16:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.80,0:16:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到了 游马。　胜利的方程式。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.27,0:16:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.02,0:16:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用希望皇霍普攻击深红暗影。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.73,0:17:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.00,0:17:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了，霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.89,0:17:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑暗是不会闭合的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.98,0:17:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动深红暗影的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.61,0:17:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个叠放单元
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让深红暗影的破坏无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.02,0:17:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔，发动速攻魔法复仇攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.57,0:17:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复仇攻击是在自己场上的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.10,0:17:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中没能破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.32,0:17:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽时发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.80,0:17:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让霍普的攻击力提升1000点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以再进行一次战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.15,0:17:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是什么光？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.17,0:18:01.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是希望皇霍普的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.21,0:18:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望之光啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.03,0:18:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}劈开黑暗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.09,0:18:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）霍普剑斩。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.95,0:18:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.31,0:18:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哦～。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.66,0:18:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑暗… 呜哦哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.05,0:18:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.90,0:18:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.81,0:18:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马和决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来是绝对无法分开的东西啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.40,0:18:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然交给你是对的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.77,0:19:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迟早那孩子都会靠自己发现
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自身力量的命运啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.32,0:19:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然能赢啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.35,0:19:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊明明那么危险。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.16,0:19:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.43,0:19:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.13,0:19:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼 呼 呼……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.51,0:19:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜噢～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}滚开 小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.17,0:19:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你没看见吗 这木像上的伤痕！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是爷爷拼命修好的痕迹啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽是你的同伴吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.45,0:19:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你重要的同伴吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.35,0:20:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.24,0:20:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.43,0:20:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我渴望力量…… 渴望强大。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.49,0:20:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那东西只能在黑暗中看到。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑暗已被驱散。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.87,0:20:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来 就看你自己了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.59,0:20:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}师父。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.69,0:20:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗川 再一次我打算重新修行。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.39,0:20:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿嘿，再打一场吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.74,0:20:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次把你的怪兽不对，还有你的同伴也一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.11,0:20:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.47,0:21:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿嘿嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然又在决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.70,0:21:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真拿你没办法。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.06,0:21:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，别太玩过头了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.94,0:21:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.29,0:21:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了～！太好了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.82,0:21:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是决斗庵秘传的卡组。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.02,0:21:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个卡组配得上由你来持有。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.06,0:21:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的心意，这个卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.86,0:21:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定会回应的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.26,0:21:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.97,0:21:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.48,0:21:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀吼～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.17,0:21:35.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害啊！这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.81,0:21:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了世界决斗狂欢节{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能强化卡组了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.84,0:21:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嚯 游马你也要出场吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.77,0:21:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 因为有必须打倒的家伙在啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧 星光体… 不在啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《看来游马已经重新振作起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.58,0:22:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是我… 我能赢吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.30,0:22:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢那个快斗》
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.55,0:22:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗 开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.24,0:22:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）本周的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.59,0:22:20.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡组中必要的卡的数量是多少张呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.50,0:24:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案是４０张。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.02,0:24:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡组里最低需要40张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.57,0:24:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过可以加入自己喜欢的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.76,0:24:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最多能增加到60张哦。

